# The built visual ruleset. A build output, not a source: it inlines six woff2
# faces as base64, so committing it would put a quarter of a megabyte of binary
# into every diff that rebuilds it, and the faces are content-hashed by the docs
# font build so that diff would churn on an unrelated repository's build. Build it
# with `pnpm build:ruleset`; `pnpm check:ruleset` falls back to the template when
# it is absent, which is how the gate runs in CI.
ruleset/ruleset.html

# Agent hooks, installed from scripts/agent-hooks/ by scripts/install-agent-hooks.mjs
# — here through `prepare`, in the applications through their postinstall. A build
# output like the generated tokens, and committed for the same reason they are not:
# a tracked copy is a hand-maintained twin, which is the drift this installer exists
# to abolish. Change the hook in scripts/agent-hooks/ and release.
/.claude/hooks/*
